SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Peroulades
LOCATION:Peroulades\, Corfu\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The village above the Loggas cliffs runs a two-night panigiri on 14 and 15 August organised by the local football club\, with well-known Corfiot folk musicians (the Skolarikis family in 2025) and dancing in the square\; food and wine from the club. Combine with sunset at Loggas beach\, then walk up\; parking in the village is tight.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#peroulades-panigiri-of-the-dormition-peroulades
